    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the magical world of Bestowment. Assemble your army as you collect cards containing ferocious creatures and powerful spells in your search for the gods who may or may not have the answers you seek. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886750/extras/d2ae9ac569179d1be686567feee4b998.avif?t=1744916740\" width=621 height=72 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who are you exactly and how did you get here? Your strange powers to control monsters are proof you are destined for greatness. Journey across the land assembling your army as you face off against powerful foes and encounter unexpected obstacles in this Collectible Card Game where choice matters and each card in your deck has a purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886750/extras/d2ae9ac569179d1be686567feee4b998.avif?t=1744916740\" width=621 height=72 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect over 500+ unique cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sprawling single player campaign experience where no 2 playthroughs will play the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a multitude of powerful foes and bosses each with their own playstyles and decks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover random events that will shape your deck for better or for worse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn cards and currency in the single player campaign that you can use to construct your own deck for online play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886750/extras/d2ae9ac569179d1be686567feee4b998.avif?t=1744916740\" width=621 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
